<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>结论：三句话带走</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>15 / 15</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '24px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: '38px', height: '38px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>它填的是一块空格，不是"更快的离线 SfM"</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>即时、无序、全局一致三者同时成立，此前没有方法做到。速度只是手段，"现场可判断"才是目的。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: '38px', height: '38px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>题眼是用"图上的距离"替换"全局优化的解"</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>判定看跳数不看时间，求解用焊接窗口得 Sim(3)，再把修正按测地距离摊给全图——回环不必重算第二遍。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: '38px', height: '38px', backgroundColor: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>代价是真的：1.2 dB 与一条更重的依赖链</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6 }}>精度上限低于全局 BA，低视差会失败，阈值靠经验。它换的是时间，不是免费午餐。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '22px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>26.29 dB</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>论文在 MipNeRF360 的成绩</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>0.5 dB</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>输入打乱后的代价</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>25.95 dB</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>我们自己跑出来的</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ margin: '16px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '15px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>一句话总结：它把 3DGS 从"拍完再算的离线工具"变成了"拍摄现场的仪表盘"，代价是让出一点精度。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '20px 40px 0px 40px', paddingBottom: '26px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>谢谢，欢迎提问</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>论文：SIGGRAPH 2026 / arXiv:2607.14481 · 代码：github.com/graphdeco-inria/i3dgs</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
